    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the ability to spend Sorcery Points to have your Misplaced Soul perform specific actions.</p><p><strong>Metamagic: Thrash (1 Sorcery Point).</strong> You may use a Bonus Action to have your Misplaced Soul use its Thrash attack. This can also be done as part of the Bonus Action you use to summon a Misplaced Soul.</p><p><strong>Metamagic: Reduce Harm (2 Sorcery Points).</strong> You may have your Misplaced Soul use its Reduce Harm as a Reaction when a creature within 5 feet of it is hit by an attack.</p><ul><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.grimnir.Item.f704bb1a9a77b5d1]{Thrash: команда}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.grimnir.Item.9205201acfcdc037]{Reduce Harm}</li></ul>"
    },
